PUBLIC ROUTES:
search space by name, capacity and by date intervals
sort space by price, popularity, capacity and date

password reset (request & reset)

CLIENT ROUTES:
create reservation
get own reservation history
cancel own reservation

ADMIN ROUTES:
change space price
change space capacity
activate/deactivate spaces

activate/deactivate/delete extra service

get client reservation history
suspend users

cancel reservations
confirm/approve reservation
change reservation date

calendary

OTHER:
equipment list to Space model
notifications
upload images to space (cdn)
pagination
